@startuml
[*] --> Unregistered : Initial state

Unregistered --> Registered : CreateAccount, ValidateRegistration
Unregistered --> LoggedIn : CreateAccount, ValidateRegistration, Login
Registered --> LoggedIn : Login
LoggedIn --> AccountManagement : EditAccountDetails, DeleteAccount
LoggedIn --> TicketStatusCheck : CheckTicketStatus
LoggedIn --> Booking : BookTicket
AccountManagement, TicketStatusCheck, Booking --> Unregistered : Logout

Booking --> [*] : Final state

@enduml
